# POSIP docs map

## Baca berurutan (agent)

1. `docs/ai/rules.md`
2. `docs/ai/business-rules.md`
3. Area: `docs/ai/frontend.md` atau `docs/ai/backend.md`
4. Domain bila perlu: `docs/domain/` (serial, promo, api, architecture)
5. Audit per menu (berjalan): `docs/quality/audits/` — mulai `01-dashboard.md`

## Tulis / update docs

- Hub: `docs/README.md`
- Konvensi header Status/SSoT: `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`
- Temuan audit menu → `docs/quality/audits/NN-slug.md` (jangan hanya di chat)
- Archive (jangan jadikan SSoT): `docs/archive/`

## Entry root

- `AGENTS.md` · `AI-AGENT.md` → `docs/ai/README.md`
- Rules Cursor: `.cursor/rules/` (folder ini)
